5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I really want us to find a way where we don't have to worry so much about every little switch. I'll look into ""Winter habits at a house paying ahead"" and ""Kitchen notice about the cooler.""","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree that we need a sustainable system. To understand the actual costs and any potential setup fees, I will look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know if the paperwork is a nightmare! I'll check the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" to see how much work it is.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're currently operating on a system designed for fewer people, I want to see if the burden is actually uneven. I'll check ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and ""Sunlight and heating need by room.""","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I think it's important to see how our current payment habits are affecting us. I'll look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Since we've all picked our topics, I'm curious to see what we find! @Ryuji, do you think the electrician's quote will be expensive? I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio It is difficult to say without the actual figures. I prefer to base my opinion on the data once I have it, rather than guessing. We should wait for the results.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I agree with Ryuji! Let's just wait and see. I'm really hoping the paperwork isn't too scary, or we'll just be spending all our free time doing math!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. Let's avoid any premature conclusions. I'm interested to see if the physical layout of the house is creating an inherent unfairness that we've simply been ignoring.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's better to look at the facts first. I'm particularly interested in whether our past disagreements over payments are a pattern we need to break with a new system.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we're all on the same page about using facts! I just hope we can find a way to make the house feel cozy again without any stress.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Cozy is a goal, but stability is the priority. If the costs fluctuate wildly, a simple agreement won't be enough. We need a system that accounts for the actual yearly cycle.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I totally get that, Ryuji! But if the system is too complicated, people might stop doing it. I just want something that's easy and doesn't make anyone grumpy!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Simplicity is a luxury, Rin, but not at the cost of accuracy. If we prioritize ease over fairness, we're just delaying the next argument. Let's see if the data supports a simpler approach.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Shunichi. If we ignore the root cause of the tension, we'll just keep having the same arguments. I hope the logs show us exactly where the friction is coming from.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see what we all discover! Let's hope the information helps us pick a way that makes everyone happy and keeps the house warm. I'll see you all in the next round!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I will be waiting for the data. Once we have the facts, we can evaluate the options logically and choose the most stable path forward. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to go imagine all the cool things we'll find out. See you guys soon! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be waiting as well. Let's hope the findings provide a clear picture of the disparities so we can stop guessing and start solving. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll be waiting too. I hope we can find a way to move past the tension and start fresh. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
