64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Option A removes the monthly friction and the cycle of questioning that has been damaging our relationships. It's the best way to restore peace to the house. I vote for A.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,It looks like we all agree! I'm so happy we found a way to make the house feel warm and friendly again. I can't wait for a cozy winter!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
